sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor D as Diyetisyen
participant API as :PlansController
participant S as :PlanService
participant PR as :INutritionPlanRepository
participant OP as eskiPlan:NutritionPlan
participant P as yeniPlan:NutritionPlan
participant UOW as :EfUnitOfWork
participant DB@{ "type": "database", "alias": "PostgreSQL" }
participant ED as :DomainEventDispatcher
participant H as :PlanPublishedHandler
participant NS as :NotificationService
participant F as :FcmPushAdapter
actor C as Danışan
D->>API: POST /api/plans/{id}/publish
API->>S: PublishAsync(dietitianId, planId)
S->>PR: GetAsync(dietitianId, planId)
PR-->>S: plan (Draft)
S->>S: alerjen kontrolü (client.GetRestriction)
alt planda danışanın alerjik olduğu besin var
  S-->>API: DomainException
  API-->>D: 400 Bad Request "Alerjen besin içeren plan yayımlanamaz"
else plan uygun
  S->>PR: GetPublishedForClientAsync(clientId)
  PR-->>S: eski yayımlanmış plan (varsa)
  S->>UOW: ExecuteInTransactionAsync(iş)
  Note over S,DB: İki adım tek transaction içinde
  S->>OP: Archive(now)
  S->>UOW: SaveChangesAsync()
  UOW->>DB: UPDATE eski plan → Archived
  S->>P: Publish(now) → Status = Published, Raise(PlanPublished)
  S->>UOW: SaveChangesAsync()
  UOW->>DB: UPDATE yeni plan → Published, COMMIT
  UOW->>ED: DispatchAsync(olaylar) — commit'ten sonra
  ED->>H: HandleAsync(PlanPublished)
  H->>NS: NotifyAsync(danışan, PlanPublished, "Yeni planın hazır")
  NS->>NS: client.AllowsNotification(PlanPublished)?
  NS->>DB: INSERT notifications (uygulama içi liste)
  opt izin açık ve cihaz anahtarı (push token) var
    NS->>F: SendAsync(token, başlık, metin)
    F-->>C: Telefona bildirim (içerikte sağlık verisi yok)
  end
  S-->>API: tamam
  API-->>D: 200 OK
end
